### ============================================================

### ALLAUTH HEADLESS — BROWSER CLIENT

### ============================================================

### Base URL

### http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/browser/v1

###

### Before POST/PUT/DELETE requests:

### - obtain a CSRF cookie

### - send Cookie + X-CSRFToken

###

### Replace placeholders with local values.

### Never commit real passwords, session IDs, or CSRF tokens.

### ============================================================

### CONFIG

### ============================================================

### Get public allauth configuration

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/browser/v1/config

### ============================================================

### SESSION / AUTHENTICATION

### ============================================================

### Get current session

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/browser/v1/auth/session

### Login

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/browser/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: csrftoken=YOUR_CSRF_TOKEN
X-CSRFToken: YOUR_CSRF_TOKEN

{
"email": "[admin@mail.com](mailto:admin@mail.com)",
"password": "YOUR_PASSWORD"
}

### Logout

DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/browser/v1/auth/session
Cookie: csrftoken=YOUR_CSRF_TOKEN; sessionid=YOUR_SESSION_ID
X-CSRFToken: YOUR_CSRF_TOKEN

### ============================================================

### SIGNUP

### ============================================================

### Signup

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/browser/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: csrftoken=YOUR_CSRF_TOKEN
X-CSRFToken: YOUR_CSRF_TOKEN

{
"email": "[newuser@example.com](mailto:newuser@example.com)",
"password": "YOUR_TEST_PASSWORD"
}

### ============================================================

### PASSWORD RESET

### ============================================================

### Request password reset

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/browser/v1/auth/password/request
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: csrftoken=YOUR_CSRF_TOKEN
X-CSRFToken: YOUR_CSRF_TOKEN

{
"email": "[admin@mail.com](mailto:admin@mail.com)"
}

### Reset password using the key from the email

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/browser/v1/auth/password/reset
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: csrftoken=YOUR_CSRF_TOKEN
X-CSRFToken: YOUR_CSRF_TOKEN

{
"key": "PASSWORD_RESET_KEY",
"password": "YOUR_NEW_PASSWORD"
}

### ============================================================

### ACCOUNT EMAIL

### ============================================================

### List email addresses

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/browser/v1/account/email
Cookie: sessionid=YOUR_SESSION_ID

### Add an email address

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/browser/v1/account/email
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: csrftoken=YOUR_CSRF_TOKEN; sessionid=YOUR_SESSION_ID
X-CSRFToken: YOUR_CSRF_TOKEN

{
"email": "[secondary@example.com](mailto:secondary@example.com)"
}

### ============================================================

### PASSWORD

### ============================================================

### Change password

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/browser/v1/account/password/change
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: csrftoken=YOUR_CSRF_TOKEN; sessionid=YOUR_SESSION_ID
X-CSRFToken: YOUR_CSRF_TOKEN

{
"current_password": "YOUR_CURRENT_PASSWORD",
"new_password": "YOUR_NEW_PASSWORD"
}

### ============================================================

### THIRD-PARTY PROVIDERS

### ============================================================

### List connected providers

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/browser/v1/account/providers
Cookie: sessionid=YOUR_SESSION_ID

