### ============================================================

### NOTES

### ============================================================

### Browser client:

### - uses Django session cookies

### - uses CSRF protection

###

### App client:

### - uses X-Session-Token instead of browser cookies

###

### Do not mix browser and app client endpoints.

### ============================================================

### User Profile

### ============================================================

### Get current user
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/me/
Cookie: sessionid={{sessionid}}

### Update current user
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/me/
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: sessionid={{sessionid}}
X-CSRFToken: {{csrftoken}}

{}

### Delete current user
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/me/
Cookie: sessionid={{sessionid}}
X-CSRFToken: {{csrftoken}}
